<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea to digest 500 billion won in Repo.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea to digest 500 billion won in Repo.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central Bank of Korea said it would siphon off 500 billion won from the banking system from Wednesday through repurchase agreement (repo).  </p>
<p>A central bank official said the bank's decision was made as banks would remain liquid after a twice-a-month deadline of won reserve requirements due on Saturday.</p>
<p>The Bank of Korea plans to invite tenders to sell the repo at 0500 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
